                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The hot afternoon sun made the workers feel completely <w>torpid</w> and unable to concentrate."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "After eating a huge holiday dinner, everyone sank into a <w>torpid</w> state on the living room sofa."
